=== IS THE TRAJECTORY REVERSIBLE?
   Same blocks, two ways: measured directly at xmax = 1e8, versus
   the 1e11 run truncated to the same block set.
   direct measurement at 1e8            gamma_hat = 14.0815
   1e11 residuals, truncated, rewindowed gamma_hat = 14.0815   (identical: True)
   1e11 residuals, truncated, LONG window gamma_hat = 14.0465   shift = -0.0350
   The residuals themselves are nested and recoverable. The WINDOW is
   a function of the whole range, so a measurement is not a state that
   later extents extend -- it is recomputed. That is the asymmetry.

